    "ind.dc.h2.liquid-cooling-and-the-stainless-steel-s": {en:"Liquid cooling and the stainless steel specification",zh:"液冷与不锈钢规格",es:"Liquid cooling y el acero inoxidable especificación",ru:"Liquid cooling и the нержавеющая сталь спецификация",ar:"Liquid cooling و the فولاذ مقاوم للصدأ المواصفات",tr:"Liquid cooling ve the paslanmaz çelik spesifikasyon",fr:"Liquid cooling et le acier inoxydable spécification",pt:"Liquid cooling e o aço inoxidável especificação",hi:"Liquid cooling और the स्टेनलेस स्टील विनिर्देश",id:"Liquid cooling dan the baja tahan karat spesifikasi"},
