    "ind.hosp.h2.why-hospital-duct-is-different-room-by-r": {en:"Why hospital duct is different room by room",zh:"医院风管为何逐房间规格不同",es:"Why hospital conducto es diferente room por room",ru:"Why больница воздуховод является другой room by room",ar:"Why مستشفى مجرى الهواء هو مختلف room بواسطة room",tr:"Why hastane kanal dır farklı room tarafından room",fr:"Why hôpital conduit est différent room par room",pt:"Why hospital duto é diferente room por room",hi:"Why अस्पताल डक्ट है अलग room द्वारा room",id:"Why rumah sakit saluran adalah berbeda room oleh room"},
